{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wouldn't everyone want to have a giant laser battle cat to overcome life's challenges with a devastating beam?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/gif1.gif?t=1744988542\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect Kittens!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers 5 kittens, each with different stats and appearances. Unlock them by completing levels and give them names. Feed them radioactive milk to make them bigger and stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/gif2.gif?t=1744988542\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Conquer Five Continents!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your cat is equipped with a vest\u2014build a laser mechanism on it. Generate power, store it in batteries, and fire away. Use rotating and sliding parts to reach all enemies. Defeat European pigeons, African snakes, and Australian spiders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098920/extras/gif3.gif?t=1744988542\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take Care of Your Home!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add extra furniture, buy pots, plant valerian and catnip. Water the plants, then prepare potions for your cat. Purchase additional workshop equipment to unlock more components for the laser mechanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel and destroy!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cat of All Cats","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3098920/0be0c12b62fba4f015be62